    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144120/extras/13ce92e13f8b8c7c3e650a1c3393814d.avif?t=1748541794\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nocturnal Nemesis</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where players navigate through eerie environments, solve puzzles, and avoid deadly enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a dark and mysterious <strong>winery</strong>, players must use stealth and strategy to survive against various nocturnal threats. Each night brings new challenges and horrors that will test your nerves and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Atmospheric horror setting with stunning 3D visuals.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Engaging story with deep lore and mysteries to uncover.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Intense survival mechanics with resource management.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Challenging puzzles and stealth-based gameplay.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Real-time tactics to outsmart enemies and stay alive.&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144120/extras/947e2ab576e49f63dec14357219d427e.poster.avif?t=1748541794\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144120/extras/947e2ab576e49f63dec14357219d427e.webp?t=1748541794\" class=\"bb_img\" width=598 height=187 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Join us for updates, events, and behind-the-scenes content</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please Note:</strong> This version of Nocturnal Nemesis is an alpha demo, showcasing the core mechanics and atmosphere. The full game will expand upon these elements with additional content and features. Your feedback is invaluable as we continue development. Thank you for understanding!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144120/extras/13ce92e13f8b8c7c3e650a1c3393814d.avif?t=1748541794\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nocturnal Nemesis</strong> is a first-person survival horror game where players navigate through eerie environments, solve puzzles, and avoid deadly enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a dark and mysterious <strong>winery</strong>, players must use stealth and strategy to survive against various nocturnal threats. Each night brings new challenges and horrors that will test your nerves and wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Atmospheric horror setting with stunning 3D visuals.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Engaging story with deep lore and mysteries to uncover.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Intense survival mechanics with resource management.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Challenging puzzles and stealth-based gameplay.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    \u2022 <i>&quot;Real-time tactics to outsmart enemies and stay alive.&quot;</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3144120/extras/947e2ab576e49f63dec14357219d427e.poster.avif?t=1748541794\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asset