        "notes": "Nocturnal Nemesis contains mature content primarily centered around horror and suspense elements. The game features:\r\n\r\n\u00b7\tCartoon/Fantasy Violence: Encounters with various hostile entities that use weapons to attack the player. These confrontations are depicted without gore or blood.\r\n\r\n\u00b7\tKilling: The main character can be killed during these encounters, adding to the game's tension and fear factor.\r\n\r\n\u00b7\tHorror Setting: The game is set in a dark, spooky environment designed to evoke fear. The atmosphere is bleak and designed to create psychological horror.\r\n\r\n\u00b7\tMild Profanity: Characters use mild profanity such as \"stupid\" and \"idiot.\"\r\n\r\n\u00b7\tCriminal Acts: The storyline involves unlawful activities, contributing to the overall sense of danger and suspense.\r\n\r\nThis game does not contain any depictions of sexual acts, extreme violence, drug or alcohol abuse, or self-harm.\r\n\r\n"
